claim.claim-text:
generating split information indicating whether a current block is to be split into at least two lower blocks;
when the current block is to be split into at least two lower blocks including horizontally neighboring lower blocks, splitting the current block into the at least two lower blocks;
determining whether an encoding order of a left lower block and a right lower block among the horizontally neighboring lower blocks is a first order from the left lower block to the right lower block or a second order from the right lower block to the left lower block; and
encoding the left lower block and the right lower block according to the first order or the second order,
characterized in that the encoding of the left lower block and the right lower block according to the first order or the second order comprises:

generating split information indicating whether a current block is to be split into at least two lower blocks;
when the current block is to be split into at least two lower blocks including horizontally neighboring lower blocks, splitting the current block into the at least two lower blocks;
determining whether an encoding order of a left lower block and a right lower block among the horizontally neighboring lower blocks is a first order from the left lower block to the right lower block or a second order from the right lower block to the left lower block;
encoding the left lower block and the right lower block according to the first order or the second order; and
outputting a bitstream including the split information, encoded data of the left lower block and the encoded data of the right lower block,
characterized in that the encoding of the left lower block and the right lower block according to the first order or the second order comprises:
